@node Top
@top Casual Avy User Guide

Version: 3.0.0-rc.1

Copyright © 2026 @w{Charles Y. Choi}

Casual Avy is an opinionated Transient (@ref{Top,,,transient,}) user interface for @uref{https://github.com/abo-abo/avy, Avy}@comma{} a GNU Emacs package for jumping to visible text using a character-based decision tree. Design motivations for Casual Avy are as follows:

@itemize
@item
Bring discoverability to many Avy commands.
@item
Bring discoverability to many commands bound with the prefix keymap @code{M-g}.
@itemize
@item
Examples include Imenu@comma{} Occur/Grep/Error navigation@comma{} line navigation.
@end itemize
@end itemize

@image{images/casual-avy-screenshot,,,,png}

Casual Avy is an extension package to Casual (@ref{Top,,,casual,})@comma{} which is included as a dependency.


If you enjoy using Casual Avy@comma{} please buy me a coffee to help support its development and maintenance.

@image{images/default-yellow,,,,png}

