@node Display Line Numbers
@section Display Line Numbers

@image{images/casual-avy-screenshot,,,,png}

If @code{display-line-numbers} is non-nil@comma{} then the menu item is displayed in the @emph{Goto Line} section:

@itemize
@item
(n) Line Number
@end itemize

@node Imenu (index) Support
@section Imenu (index) Support

@image{images/casual-avy-org-screenshot,,,,png}

The Emacs Imenu (index menu) (@ref{Imenu,,,emacs,}) feature offers a way to navigate to a major definition in a file@comma{} provided that the current mode supports it. As Imenu behavior is closely related to Avy@comma{} support for it is provided here as the menu item labeled ``(i) Index''.

@node Org Support
@section Org Support

@image{images/casual-avy-org-screenshot,,,,png}

If the current buffer is an Org file@comma{} then two menu items are supported:

@itemize
@item
(o) Org heading
@item
(g) Org Goto…
@end itemize

Selecting ``Org heading'' will invoke the @code{avy-org-goto-heading-timer} command. Note as with all other Avy commands@comma{} this will only work with Org headings that are visible. If navigation to any Org header is desired@comma{} select ``Org Goto…'' to invoke the command @code{org-goto}.

